{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Extracurricular Pack includes 12 new game cards (3 rare, 4 uncommon, 5 common) designed by Orange Juice, and illustrated by Oyama, 490, jo, Kagawa Yusaku, TangoStar, Azuree, and Coffgirl. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The pack contains:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 new Banner cards: Protection Fee, Fluffy and Fuzzy, and Feel the Rush with an Energy Drink</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 new Boost cards: Full Burst, Chef's Special, and Go with the Flow</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2 new Battle cards: Mousse the Thief and Coming Back Stronger</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2 new Event cards: Extreme Alteration and The Greatest Troublemaker Ever</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2 new Gift cards: Look How Long My Arms and Legs Are Now and We're Ticked Off</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The cards of the set can be purchased from the in-game shop and used in both single and multiplayer. All cards in a multiplayer game can be used by all players via the center deck, even if they do not own the DLC.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3811450?t=1751916648","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3811450?t=1751916648","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811450/ab663d57f85d4809acdd61e35767da9666cc361e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751916648","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811450/ab663d57f85d4809acdd61e35767da9666cc361e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751916648","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":